# Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause and fix |
|---|---|
| Partition table error at build | Flash size still 2 MB. Recheck 0.4. |
| Node.js `SyntaxError` on `idf.py` | Plain PowerShell. Use the ESP-IDF shell. |
| `Select-String` not recognized | You are in `cmd.exe`, not PowerShell. |
| No COM port listed | Other USB-C port, then a different cable. |
| Download starts then fails | Wrong URL, firewall, or `.bin` not in the served folder. |
| Boot loops between slots | `self_test()` failing. Check `/health` exists and the IMU answers. That is the mechanism working. |
| `selftest: NVS namespace missing` | The `nvs_open(..., NVS_READWRITE, ...)` block in `app_main` is missing or runs after the self-test. |
| `health: ... status 404` | No `health` file in the serving folder. |
| Reboots into the same old image | `otadata` not updated; validation failed. Read the log. |
| Stack overflow inside mbedTLS | `ota` task stack too small. 8192 minimum. |
| TLS errors | Path B only. On Path A there should be no cert bundle. |
| `example_connect` undefined | `EXTRA_COMPONENT_DIRS` missing or below the `include()`. |
| Config change does not apply | `sdkconfig` still exists. Defaults are read only when it is absent. |

